{"3379750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Manifest369 power defence", "steam_appid": 3379750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Island Reclamation</strong> is a gripping post-apocalyptic survival experience where fragmented islands hold the key to humanity’s rebirth. As a resilient survivor, your mission is clear: restore power, rebuild infrastructure, and navigate the fragile balance between diplomacy and survival. ⚡</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reactivating the islands’ main power lines is only the beginning. You must construct and maintain power stations across hostile territory while supplying electricity to isolated settlements where traders live. Without power, these communities refuse to cooperate. With it, they may reward you — if they trust you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every settlement controls critical resources such as sawmills, mines, and transport access. Carefully choose when to negotiate, when to trade, and when to scavenge abandoned buildings for valuables to exchange for gold. Use your earnings to unlock access to essential materials like wood, stone, iron, and vehicles needed to expand your reach across the islands. 🚗</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But restoring power attracts attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every <strong>7 days</strong>, waves of enemy troops launch coordinated assaults on your power stations. Build defensive <strong>turrets</strong>, reinforce positions, and prepare your infrastructure for survival against escalating attacks. Protecting your grid becomes just as important as building it. 🔧🛡️</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust matters. Settlements that respect you will reward your efforts with gold for providing power. Distrustful communities may still trade—but only if you keep your weapon lowered. Draw your firearm, and you’ll have only seconds before negotiations turn into gunfire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cars and trailers become essential for transporting large quantities of materials across dangerous terrain, overcoming strict carrying limits as you expand and defend the electrical network linking the islands together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your strategy. Trade, negotiate, defend, or take risks when necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The future of the islands—and the fragile return of civilization—rests in your hands. 🌍⚡</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Island Reclamation</strong> is a gripping post-apocalyptic survival experience where fragmented islands hold the key to humanity’s rebirth. As a resilient survivor, your mission is clear: restore power, rebuild infrastructure, and navigate the fragile balance between diplomacy and survival. ⚡</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reactivating the islands’ main power lines is only the beginning. You must construct and maintain power stations across hostile territory while supplying electricity to isolated settlements where traders live. Without power, these communities refuse to cooperate. With it, they may reward you — if they trust you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every settlement controls critical resources such as sawmills, mines, and transport access. Carefully choose when to negotiate, when to trade, and when to scavenge abandoned buildings for valuables to exchange for gold. Use your earnings to unlock access to essential materials like wood, stone, iron, and vehicles needed to expand your reach across the islands. 🚗</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But restoring power attracts attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every <strong>7 days</strong>, waves of enemy troops launch coordinated assaults on your power stations. Build defensive <strong>turrets</strong>, reinforce positions, and prepare your infrastructure for survival against escalating attacks. Protecting your grid becomes just as important as building it. 🔧🛡️</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust matters. Settlements that respect you will reward your efforts with gold for providing power. Distrustful communities may still trade—but only if you keep your weapon lowered. Draw your firearm, and you’ll have only seconds before negotiations turn into gunfire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cars and trailers become essential for transporting large quantities of materials across dangerous terrain, overcoming strict carrying limits as you expand and defend the electrical network linking the islands together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your strategy. Trade, negotiate, defend, or take risks when necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The future of the islands—and the fragile return of civilization—rests in your hands. 🌍⚡</p>", "short_description": "Restore power to fragmented islands in a post-apocalyptic base-building sandbox. Start from a hidden cave with 1,200+ items, rebuild infrastructure, earn settlement trust, and trade, loot or negotiate—while defending power stations with turrets from enemy waves every 7 days. ⚡🛡️", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379750/4ed51841db8f503cce3a26b56220d7aef47e131e/header.jpg?t=1775600357", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379750/edeb1c57dd00a0e81b32bc1f60ebebe52c1c65ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775600357", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379750/edeb1c57dd00a0e81b32bc1f60ebebe52c1c65ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775600357", "website": "https://steamcommunity.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.0ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2060 8gb<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage