nes.\r\n\r\nSelf-harm/Suicide:Suicide Only as a reset machanic.\r\n\r\nAlcohol: Not depicted and no alcohol abuse mechanics.\r\n\r\nAdditional notes:\r\n\r\nIncludes tense horror atmosphere that some players may find distressing (threat, darkness, corpses).\r\n\r\nDrug content is presented in a fictional survival context and does not endorse real-world use."}, "ratings": {"dejus": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "18", "required_age": "18", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Violência Extrema\nDrogas ilícitas\nLinguagem imprópria"}, "steam_germany": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "18", "required_age": "18", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Drastische Gewalt\nDrogen\nDerbe Sprache"}, "igrs": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "18", "required_age": "18", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Kekerasan\nRokok dan/atau rokok elektronik, minuman beralkohol, narkotika, psikotropika, dan/atau zat adiktif lainnya\nPenggunaan bahasa"}}}}}